################################################################################
# SPARTA logo, idea 2: a shock front crossing the emblem
#
# A dense cold slug of gas is fed in at xlo for the whole run and drives a
# front to the right across the box.  The emblem is a 10x-mass species, heavy
# enough to hold together as the front passes over it, light enough to visibly
# respond rather than sit there inert.
#
# This shape is forced by the physics, and it took several dead ends to see it:
#
#  - fix move/surf cannot drive a shock.  SPARTA finds particle-surface
#    collisions along the particle's own path, so a slab sweeping across a gas
#    at rest registers no collisions (nscoll stays 0) and the particles it
#    overruns are deleted - 42k of them, a clean wipe with no compression.
#  - fix rigid from surf-rigid-body does drive one, correctly and with nothing
#    deleted.  But a piston that strikes and stops cannot send a front across
#    the box at any speed: a finite stroke's front decays as 1/x while the heat
#    it leaves behind does not decay at all, so beyond about twice the stroke
#    length the shocked gas diffuses faster than its own front advances.
#    Hitting harder does not help - 7500 m/s just adds ~50000 K and vaporises
#    the emblem - and neither does waiting: at 30000 steps the emblem was gone
#    by step 5000 and the front had barely moved.  Hence a sustained drive.
#  - the slab also has to go.  Parked at x = -59 it sits across the inlet and
#    reflects the driver straight back out, which shows up as a particle count
#    that never grows.
#  - surf_collide piston is Bird's subsonic pressure BC, a wall receding from
#    the incident particle, so it cannot compress anything.
#
# The gas is at essentially zero temperature, so nothing diffuses ahead of the
# front and the emblem is pixel-crisp until the shock reaches it.
################################################################################

dimension           2
seed                12345
global              gridcut 0.0 comm/sort yes
boundary            oo rr p

create_box          -600e-1 600e-1 -600e-1 600e-1 -0.5 0.5
create_grid         100 100 1
balance_grid        rcb cell

include             emblem.regions

species             logo.species N O B Nh Oh Nm Om
global              fnum 8.4e16

mixture             gold Nm nrho 1.17e18 temp 0.001
mixture             red  Om nrho 1.17e18 temp 0.001
mixture             bg   B nrho 1.17e18 temp 0.001
mixture             driver B nrho 4.7e18 temp 0.001 vstream 800.0 0.0 0.0

create_particles    gold n 0 region goldletters
create_particles    gold n 0 region swirlsIn
create_particles    gold n 0 region outerring
create_particles    gold n 0 region innerring
create_particles    red  n 0 region redcenter
create_particles    red  n 0 region redband
create_particles    bg   n 0 region freefield

collide             vss all logo.vss
collide_modify      vremax 100 yes

timestep            1.0e-4
stats               200
stats_style         step cpu np ncoll nscoll

dump                3 image all 23 pis.*.ppm type type pdiam 0.9 &
                    box no 1 size 500 500 &
                    view 0 0 center s 0.5 0.5 0.5 zoom 1.98
dump_modify         3 pad 5 backcolor white &
                    color shieldred 0.75 0 0 color shieldgold 0.95 0.75 0.05 &
                    color gas 0.55 0.68 0.82 color steel 0.20 0.22 0.26 &
                    pcolor 6 shieldgold pcolor 7 shieldred pcolor 3 gas &
                    ptrans 3 0.5

# ---- driven the whole way, so the front does not decay ----
fix                 drive emit/face driver xlo
run                 1400
